{s:"necro",t:"Necro Museum",tag:"Unity, interactive horror",st:"Completed, graded 18/20",ls:"Completed",
sum:"An interactive museum inside a necromancer’s dark mansion, where he keeps the souls of the powerful beings he has collected.",
f:{Role:"Lead builder and developer",Tools:"Unity, scripting",Context:"First-year assignment at KdG",Result:"18/20"},
b:"The goal was to build an interactive horror museum in Unity, using our own edited photos as the ghosts. I used it to combine everything I knew about 3D, Unity and storytelling.",
d:["Built the house and many of the objects inside it","Designed the whole area, indoors and outdoors","Set the lighting and the sound","Wrote the necromancer’s monologue, and gave every ghost a monologue of its own","Turned semi-AI images into animated GIFs on rotating planes to bring the ghosts to life","Wrote the scripts that tie it together"],
n:"Credits: some props are downloaded Unity assets, and the ghost images are AI-assisted, then edited and animated by me. I did most of the work myself, which my teammates have confirmed.",
ex:[["The story", "A powerful necromancer collects the souls of great and mighty beings and keeps them in his house, which doubles as a museum. The collection includes a pair of twins, a great pirate, a great vampire, a bride and a nun. The ghosts don’t symbolise anything specific. We added the characters that seemed the most interesting to us."], ["How it works", "A trigger zone detects the player, and when the player enters it, the ghosts appear. Each ghost is a billboard showing an animated GIF on a green background. They are simple, but they were the best I could produce in the time available."]],
hero:"nh1",hc:"The house at night, seen from the graveyard.",
vids:[["AYtVhPkl9lg","Gameplay video","A walk through the museum: the house, the graveyard and the ghosts."]],
g:[["nh0","The in-game poster at the entrance."],["nh3","The living room: fireplace, trophy skull, wine and candle."],["nh2","The study with its gramophone, globe and skull."],["nh4","The hall leading into the main room."],["nh5","Captive ghosts, each in a summoning circle."],["nh6","A bride and a ghost in the upper room."]],
